  "question": "If A = (9)/(16) div (25)/(36), B = 9 ÷ [(16 ÷ 25) ÷ 36], C = [9 ÷ (16 ÷ 25)] ÷ 36, D = (9 ÷ 16) ÷ (25 ÷ 36), then which of the following is true?",
